    <string name="help_text">• Tap + on the home screen to create an animation.\n• The frames at the bottom of the editor are key frames. Pose each one and the app fills in the motion between them.\n• Pose &amp; move: blue dots move, red dots pose\n• Stretch &amp; style: orange dots stretch, teal dots change color and thickness\n• Flip: the purple dot\n• Long-press a frame to duplicate or delete it.\n• Save as video to get an MP4, or save a backup (.sfa) to load it again later.</string>
